==Trivia==
*The location was first slightly expanded with [[Changelog#v0.6.0.861_(19_Jan_2018)|patch 0.6.0.861]] on January 19, 2018.
*The location was expanded for the second time with [[Changelog#v0.11.0.2448_(25_Dec_2018)|patch 0.11.0.2448]] on December 25, 2018.
*The location was expanded again with [[Changelog#0.12.7.8334_(20_Jul_2020)|patch 0.12.7.8334]] on July 20, 2020.
*The location was completely reworked and expanded with [[Changelog#0.16.0.0.34447_(26_December_2024)|patch 0.16.0.0.34447]] on December 26, 2024.

